 belongs to the ordinary manuscript model; formal-interface hypotheses remain on the separate Lean target. This classification does not prove a transport between formal models.","citation_ids":["support_closure_source","support_closure_lean_source","support_contact_source"],"evidence_ids":["support_source_bindings_20261024","support_graph_semantic_review_pending"],"id":"support.no_initial_gap","kind":"claim","label":"No initial gap when zero is outside the support","locator":"variation.tex:239–242; initial-gap case","source_id":"support_tex_variation","statement":"For an admissible minimizer gamma, an initial support-complement component [0,b), with 0<b<1 and b in S, is impossible. Since mu([0,b))=0, gamma=0 on [0,b). The zero-interval result gives q'(t)<q'(b)<=1 for 0<t<b, but symmetry gives q(0)=0 and contact at b gives q(b)=b. Integration contradicts these two values.","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.no_initial_gap","relations":[{"derived":true,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.no_initial_gap","id":"field:b86d99a2bf132926d190fcedf3bcb924153342a500a9a2198a718d5f6026e9c3","kind":"assumption_ids","owner_ref":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.no_initial_gap","semantic_class":"explicit_assumption_reference","source_field":"assumption_ids","to":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/scalar.paper_minimizer"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/nodes/support.full_relative_support","id":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/edges/%5B%22support.full_relative_support%22%2C%22support.no_initial_gap%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd